{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "# DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash — model  \nRead top → bottom, left column (L0–19) then right column (L20–39). **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where the parameters and the compute live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length. Zoom in: *Layer* tab = one layer, *Attention* tab = its attention."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "Layer rows — **SWA**: sliding window (128 tokens) only · **Full**: computes its own compressed KV + indexer, shared by the next layers · **Reindex**: reuses that KV, runs a fresh indexer (top 512) · **Reuse**: reuses KV and index picks · **+E**: reads an Engram table · **▸ DSpark**: output also feeds the draft model.    \nEach layer ≈ **13.75B** (Full +10.7M for its KV compressor + indexer, Reindex +5.4M); all 40 = **550.24B**, ~99% of it in the 384 routed experts, of which 6 run per token."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
