   "type": "text",
   "x": 1396,
   "y": 378,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L38 → DSpark"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-tap39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1396,
   "y": 418,
   "width": 230,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "↳ output of L39 → DSpark"
  },
  {
   "id": "dproj43",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 616,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**main_proj** 15360 → 5120 + norm",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dblk44",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 712,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**DSpark draft model** — 3 blocks  \nMoE top-3 of 128 · 4.77B per block",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dhead45",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 808,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**head + Markov bias** → 5 draft tokens  \nand a confidence score",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dids46",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 904,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl47",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2790,
   "y": 894,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft ids [5]`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dver48",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 958,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**verify**: big model runs all 5 drafts  \nin ONE forward pass",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-dspark",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2470,
   "y": 1034,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "Speculative decoding. Without DSpark: 1 big forward per token. With it: the small model guesses 5 tokens, the big model checks them together; every draft it agrees with is a token gained without its own big forward. The verify/accept loop is the standard scheme — this repo's code ships only the draft model's forward pass."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpt",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1686,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Where the parameters are stored** — total 763.21B"
  },
